<title>SLOVENIA: TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD SLOVENIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NORWAY LEAD SLOVENIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>NOVA GORICA, Slovenia 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway led</p>
<p>Slovenia 2-0 after the first day of their Davis Cup Euro/African</p>
<p>zone, group two second round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Norwegian names first):</p>
<p>Christian Ruud beat Iztok Bozij 4-6 6-2 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Jan Frode Andersen beat Blaz Trupej 4-6 6-4 6-3 6-1.</p>
</text>
